{
  "TanStack Query dependent query (JavaScript)": {
    "prefix": "queryDependent",
    "body": [
      "export function ${1:ProjectsForUser}({ ${2:userId} }) {",
      "  const ${3:projectsQuery} = useQuery({",
      "    queryKey: ['${4:projects}', ${2}],",
      "    queryFn: ({ signal }) => ${5:getProjects}(${2}, signal),",
      "    enabled: Boolean(${2}),",
      "  });",
      "",
      "  if (!${2}) {",
      "    return <p>Select a user first.</p>;",
      "  }",
      "",
      "  return (",
      "    <ul>",
      "      {${3}.data?.map((item) => <li key={item.id}>{item.name}</li>)}",
      "    </ul>",
      "  );",
      "}",
      "$0"
    ],
    "description": "Hold a query until its input exists, so it never runs with an undefined key. Requires useQuery from @tanstack/react-query and a fetcher.\n\n在输入就绪前挂起查询，避免以 undefined 作为键发起请求；需要 @tanstack/react-query 的 useQuery，以及请求函数。",
    "scope": "javascriptreact"
  },
