      "$0"
    ],
    "description": "Hold a query until its input exists, so it never runs with an undefined key. Requires useQuery from @tanstack/react-query and a fetcher.\n\n在输入就绪前挂起查询，避免以 undefined 作为键发起请求；需要 @tanstack/react-query 的 useQuery，以及请求函数。",
